sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Boot as Startup
  participant Lock as Toolchain Lock
  participant Probe as Version Probe
  participant Smoke as Smoke Runner
  participant Gate as Compatibility Gate
  participant Admin
  participant Exec as Real Execution
  Boot->>Lock: read lock + hashes
  Lock-->>Boot: expected versions
  Boot->>Probe: inspect opencode / OMO / plugins / skills
  Probe-->>Boot: installed versions
  alt 版本漂移
    Boot->>Smoke: run T1/T2
    Smoke-->>Gate: smoke result
    Gate-->>Exec: real execution disabled
    Gate-->>Admin: drift + required action
    Admin-->>Gate: acknowledge / upgrade
    Gate->>Lock: update reviewable pin
  else 完全匹配
    Gate-->>Exec: real execution enabled
  end
  Note over Lock,Exec: 真实执行失败关闭；pin 更新必须单独评审
